---
title: "How does filing session notes onto an Event Task work?"
accTitle: "Event-attached session-note filing"
accDescr: "A source file or clipboard and an Event Task handle together derive parent, title, and stem, promote Markdown into a meeting dossier, create a meets reference born Next, relate it to the Event Task, and optionally offer follow-up tasks."
config:
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 12
    nodeSpacing: 16
    wrappingWidth: 260
---
flowchart TD
  subgraph INPUTS["Both required"]
    direction LR
    SRC["`**Source**<br/>File or clipboard`"]
    EVT["`**Event handle**<br/>Caret or Google id`"]
  end
  DERIVE["`**Derive**<br/>Root, title, stem`"]
  PROMOTE["`**Promote Markdown**<br/>H1, H2s, dossier header`"]
  CREATE["`**Create meets ref**<br/>Born Next under root`"]
  REL["`**Write notes of**<br/>Relation on both ends`"]
  OFFER["`**Offer follow-ups**<br/>Never auto-create`"]
  INPUTS ==> DERIVE
  DERIVE ==> PROMOTE
  PROMOTE ==> CREATE
  CREATE ==> REL
  REL -.->|"optional"| OFFER
  classDef focus fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#3B78C2,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0F2E52
  classDef muted fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#6B7280,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1F2937
  classDef outcome fill:#E7F5EC,stroke:#2E7D4F,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#123D24
  classDef proposed stroke-dasharray:5 3
  class SRC,EVT focus
  class DERIVE,PROMOTE muted
  class CREATE,REL,OFFER outcome
  class OFFER proposed
  style INPUTS fill:none,stroke:#3B78C2
